Z||000000||gtsonly||05-09-2000||10:53 AM||||I have a 1986 1/2 GT with T-tops. I have found some great sites on the internet but what I truely am looking for is a site or info on my car. if there is such a site!!!! something i may be able to put my vin# in and it gives me a history of dealer ops or what the car came with new!! She is mint condition and all original with exceptions done by cars and concepts ie: t-tops and cruise control. one final thing, does the 86 1/2 have the muncie tranny?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||05-09-2000||11:55 AM||||Try <A HREF="http://www.carfax.com" TARGET=_blank>www.carfax.com</A>  for the vehicle history by VIN. The 86GT came with a 4spd mostly. Near the end of the 86 production run is when GM started using the 5spd Getreg. So most V-6 manual transmissions were 4spd that year. I am not sure of the actual production numbers of how many actually got the Getreg.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Phil||05-09-2000||03:08 PM||||If you want to know what your car came with originally check the rpo sheet on the left front fender. ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fformula88||05-09-2000||03:35 PM||||You can also get info from Pontiac Historical Services... <A HREF="http://www.phs-online.com/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.phs-online.com/index.html</A> <P>They send a pack of info, including copies of the original invioce for your car (its off microfiche, so the wuality isn't great, but readable) and a bunch of other info. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||2birds||05-09-2000||07:03 PM||||If you have a V-6 and  a 5speed, regardless of the year, you have a Muncie/Getrag, unless someone has messed with it.  Mine was built in June of 86, and has that combo.   Haynes manual has a decent enough picture to ID the difference between the M/G or the Isuzu, if you're worried.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Gokart||05-09-2000||08:41 PM||||Hey Chris, Fformula88 posted the site I had in my favorites I was going to send you. Here's another <A HREF="http://www.fiero.net/vin.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.net/vin.html</A>  Looking forward to seeing your T-top. Give me a call Saturday if you don't have any plans, Marc.||||reg||6
